{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50130","headline":"唵字赞（义静三藏於西天取得此梵书「唵」字，所在之地，一切鬼神，见闻者无不惊怖。） · 唐明皇","name":"唵字赞（义静三藏於西天取得此梵书「唵」字，所在之地，一切鬼神，见闻者无不惊怖。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤立蛇行势未休，五天文字鬼神愁。\n儒门弟子无人识，穿耳胡僧笑点头。\n（〖1〗京兆住持十方福应禅院讲经论传戒沙门惟果立石。\n〖2〗大宋丁巳熙宁十年〖一○七七〗八月二十六日安石师刊。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐明皇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}